<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIX FOR FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIX FOR FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Friday:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,599.90 (1,598.60)	CHF  1,113.50 (1,106.60)</p>
<p>    DEM    957.57 (956.67)	  GBP  2,624.80 (2,626.30)</p>
<p>    ATS    136.06 (135.96)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Thursday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>Banks bought  $32.23 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold    $24.94 million</p>
<p>Total turover $57.17 million ($39.51 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569; 981 4145</p>
</text>
